  message: "DONE: merged in PR #1381 (commit ed76410b51). http.py (13 sites), graphql.py and message_queue.py now take their language from js_ts_language_from_path (the INV-tofun helper matching the analyzer's tags); the helper maps .mts/.cts to typescript (also fixing solidity_abi's .mts scan); websocket.py no longer mints a duplicate `tsx:` file node for a .tsx sender. The row's own suggestion (core language_from_path) would itself have been wrong (.tsx -> tsx, .mts -> None). NOT changed (mispremised part of the row): graphql_resolver / event_sourcing / database_query `_detect_language` only select a scanner; their records already use the helper. Behavioural evidence: direct calls returned javascript for .ts and tsx for .tsx on dev, typescript on the branch; fixture survey: identical 36-edge set apart from the language part of ids; confidence follows (TS->TS 0.8 -> 0.9; TS publisher -> JS subscriber 0.9 -> 0.8). Corpus: full-stack-fastapi-template 23 call-site nodes relabelled, 0 edge changes. Residuals: WI-pokij, WI-hizon (P3). Report: run_09302026/komum.md"  # 95cd
